      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.46 (vs ₹1.10 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.46 (up from ₹1.10 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹6.71b (up 19% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹582.3m (up 33% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 8.7% (up from 7.8% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 9.9% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 13% growth forecast for the Machinery industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 1% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 10% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
